h Wikipedia** contains **over 7 million articles** (the 7-million milestone was passed in November 2024; the count rises continuously). [1][2]\\n   - Across **all language editions**, Wikipedia contains **over 60 million articles** combined. [1]\\n\\n**Caveats:** Article counts are dynamic and change daily; figures above reflect the most recent widely reported milestones (2024\\u20132025). The \\\"Wikipedia\\\" article itself notes these numbers as approximate, citing the live statistics page for current totals. [1][2]\\n\\n**Sources:**\\n[1] English Wikipedia article \\\"Wikipedia\\\" \\u2014 https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia\\n[2] Wikipedia statistics / Main Page \\u2014 https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:Statistics\"", "gen_ai.tool.call.id": "call_-7227414628899225450"}, "events": [], "links": [], "resource": {"attributes": {"telemetry.sdk.language": "python", "telemetry.sdk.name": "opentelemetry", "telemetry.sdk.version": "1.44.0", "service.instance.id": "9eafec57-4fa8-43c8-932b-f4a45b427cc0", "service.name": "abb-evaluation"}, "schema_url": ""}, "live": false, "trace_id": "254e13c60c63a3f9dc81a3371971137b", "span_id": "4f714f32902e33da", "parent_span_id": "1d2f104ea6f7cfab", "start_time_unix_nano": "1790401592295272555", "end_time_unix_nano": "1790401617658189090", "dropped_attributes": 0, "dropped_events": 0, "dropped_links": 0}}
